  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2>TJU Affiliate Program – Earn 20% While Giving Back</h2><p>Join the TJU (Just Knate) Affiliate Program and earn a <strong>20% commission on every product sold</strong> while supporting real people through our <strong>Buy One Give One</strong> mission.</p><p>TJU is a creator-led, mission-driven brand built around kindness, transparency, and real-world impact. Every product purchased through your affiliate link provides an identical item to someone experiencing homelessness.</p><p>This program is designed for <strong>content creators, influencers, bloggers, and community leaders</strong> who want to promote meaningful products with a purpose.</p><hr><h3>Program Highlights</h3><p>Earn a <strong>flat 20% commission</strong> on all products.<br>Receive a <strong>30-day tracking cookie</strong> on every referral.<br>Get a <strong>custom affiliate link</strong> and optional personal discount code.<br>Track clicks, sales, and earnings in a simple dashboard.<br>No caps or limits on earnings.</p><p>Affiliate commissions do not replace donations or reduce Buy One Give One product giveaways.</p><hr><h3>Why Promote TJU?</h3><p>TJU is not a faceless brand. All outreach and donations are documented through real on-the-ground content. Affiliates partner with a brand built on trust, authenticity, and measurable impact.</p><p>If your audience values kindness, community, and making a difference, TJU is a natural fit.</p><hr><h3>Who We’re Looking For</h3><p>We welcome applications from creators and supporters who align with our mission. Applications may be reviewed to ensure responsible and respectful promotion.</p><hr><p>Apply today and help grow <strong>#TeamJustUs</strong> while earning 20% on every sale.</p></div></div>",
